\",\n  \"question\": \"Who can view the overdue list and send reminders, and where do staff accounts come from?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Any authenticated staff user, using the existing API's authentication\",\n  \"by\": \"ASM-1,ASM-2,ASM-3,ASM-4,ASM-5 (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-2\",\n  \"question\": \"Is an invoice exactly 7 days past its due date overdue, or does it only become overdue from day 8?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Overdue from day 7 (today >= due date + 7)\",\n  \"by\": \"ASM-1,ASM-2,ASM-3,ASM-4,ASM-5 (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-3\",\n  \"question\": \"Does reminder history record only successful sends, or every attempt including failures?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Every attempt, each with a delivery status (sent / failed + reason)\",\n  \"by\": \"ASM-1,ASM-2,ASM-3,ASM-4,ASM-5 (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-4\",\n  \"question\": \"Payments are out of scope, so how does an invoice leave the overdue list (for example, once it is paid)?\",\n  \"answer\": \"A paid/closed status in the existing invoice data removes it automatically\",\n  \"by\": \"ASM-1,ASM-2,ASM-3,ASM-4,ASM-5 (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-5\",\n  \"question\": \"Can staff send another reminder for an invoice that was already reminded, and how do we stop accidental double clicks?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Repeat reminders allowed at any time; only accidental double submits are blocked\",\n  \"by\": \"ASM-1,ASM-2,ASM-3,ASM-4,ASM-5 (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-6\",\n  \"question\": \"Should 'overdue' be worked out each time from the due date and paid status, or saved as a status on the invoice record?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Worked out each time; nothing is written to invoices\",\n  \"by\": \"ASM-6,ASM-7,ASM-8 (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-7\",\n  \"question\": \"Where does the customer's email address come from, and what happens if there isn't one or there are several?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Single email field on the existing customer record; block sending if missing\",\n  \"by\": \"ASM-6,ASM-7,ASM-8 (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-8\",\n  \"question\": \"What counts as a 'delivery failure' that gets recorded with a reason?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Send-time errors plus later bounces reported back by the provider\",\n  \"by\": \"ASM-6,ASM-7,ASM-8 (via web)\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"assumptions\" kind=\"assumptions\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-4\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-1\",\n   \"I-2\",\n   \"I-5\",\n   \"I-7\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-1\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"Where do invoices and customers come from? The request mentions the client's existing .NET 8 API, but no repository was found. → assumed: They already exist in the client's API and Postgres database; we read them from there\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-6\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-1\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-2\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Is the overdue status saved by a scheduled job, or worked out from the due date each time it is needed? → assumed: Worked out from due date and today's date each time it is queried\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-7\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-1\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-3\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Is the 7-day overdue threshold fixed in code or a configuration setting? → assumed: Configuration setting, default 7\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-8\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-5\",\n   \"I-6\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-4\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"How is 'days overdue' counted for display and filtering? → assumed: Days since the due date\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-9\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-5\",\n   \"I-6\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-5\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"What kind of input is the days-overdue filter? → assumed: Fixed buckets (7–30, 31–60, 61–90, 90+)\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-10\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-2\",\n   \"I-4\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-6\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"Which email service sends reminders, and what counts as a delivery failure? → assumed: Transactional provider (e.g. SendGrid/Postmark) with send errors plus bounces reported later by webhook\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-12\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-2\",\n   \"I-4\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-7\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Which address does a reminder go to, and what if the customer has none or several? → assumed: One billing email on the customer record; sending is blocked with an error if it is missing\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-13\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-2\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-8\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Who supplies the reminder email wording and the from address? → assumed: Client provides wording; template stored in config\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-14\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-1\",\n   \"I-5\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-9\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Which timezone is used to decide what day it is for the overdue calculation? → assumed: The business's local timezone (configured)\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-7\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-1\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-10\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Should the 7-day threshold be fixed in the code or a setting? → assumed: App setting (config file/env)\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-8\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-1\",\n   \"I-5\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-11\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Which timezone defines 'today' when checking due date + 7 days? → assumed: The business's local timezone (fixed setting)\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-9\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-2\",\n   \"I-4\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-12\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"How should emails be sent? → assumed: The client's existing email service/SMTP relay\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-12\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-2\",\n   \"I-6\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-13\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"How should accidental double submits be blocked (from Q-5)? → assumed: Client disable plus a server-side check that rejects a second send for the same invoice within a short window (e.g. 60s)\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-13\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-5\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-14\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"How should the 'days overdue' filter work, and what is it counted from? → assumed: Preset ranges past due date (7–14, 15–30, 30+)\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-14\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-2\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-15\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Who decides the wording, sender address and language of the reminder email? → assumed: A fixed template we draft, approved by the client\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-15\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-6\",\n   \"I-7\",\n   \"I-4\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-16\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Can reminders only be sent from the overdue list, or also from the invoice detail screen (for example, to retry after a failure)? → assumed: Both overdue list and invoice detail\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"cb\" kind=\"current-behaviour\" sha=\"\">\n{\n \"claims\": [],\n \"header\": {\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-01T12:08:25.829Z\",\n  \"inputsHash\": \"\",\n  \"kind\": \"current-behaviour\",\n  \"producedBy\": {\n   \"stage\": \"ground\"\n  },\n  \"runId\": \"20261001-invoice-reminders-a-small-06fa\",\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1\n },\n \"notFound\": [\n  {\n   \"searched\": [\n    \"no repository: this is new build work\"\n   ],\n   \"span\": \"I-1\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"searched\": [\n    \"no repository: this is new build work\"\n   ],\n   \"span\": \"I-2\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"searched\": [\n    \"no repository: this is new build work\"\n   ],\n   \"span\": \"I-3\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"searched\": [\n    \"no repository: this is new build work\"\n   ],\n   \"span\": \"I-4\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"searched\": [\n    \"no repository: this is new build work\"\n   ],\n   \"span\": \"I-5\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"searched\": [\n    \"no repository: this is new build work\"\n   ],\n   \"span\": \"I-6\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"searched\": [\n    \"no repository: this is new build work\"\n   ],\n   \"span\": \"I-7\"\n  }\n ]\n}\n</artifact>\n\n<untrusted_document id=\"request\" source=\"cli\">\n# Invoice reminders\n\nA small web app for a bakery wholesaler. Staff see which customer invoices are overdue and send a reminder by email.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- When an invoice is 7 days past its due date, the system shall mark it overdue and show it on the overdue list.\n- When staff press \"Send reminder\" on an overdue invoice, the system shall email the customer a reminder with the invoice number, amount and due date.\n- The system shall record each reminder sent, with who sent it and when, and show the history on the invoice.\n- If an email cannot be delivered, the system shall show the failure on the invoice and keep it on the overdue list.\n- Staff shall be able to filter the overdue list by customer and by days overdue.\n\n## Screens\n\n- Overdue list (table, filters, a \"Send reminder\" button per row)\n- Invoice detail (amount, due date, reminder history, delivery failures)\n\n## Out of scope\n\nPayments, customer logins, SMS reminders.\n\n## Stack\n\nClient's existing .NET 8 API with a React front end. Postgres.\n</untrusted_document>\n\nWrite the spec (independent draft 2)."}